Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.90,0:00:03.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Papa.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.96,0:00:04.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.00,0:00:07.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did she just smack her own alley?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.28,0:00:10.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So was it you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.24,0:00:14.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The one who burned Okobore Town?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.68,0:00:16.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.12,0:00:18.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.94,0:00:22.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna squash you ever,\Never so flat, Big Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.08,0:00:27.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nobody hurts my Papa! Uh-oh! Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.76,0:00:30.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe we can have Big\NMom beat up Ulti, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.18,0:00:36.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, I thought Big Mom was a\Ndemon, but maybe she's really a goddess.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.82,0:00:37.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.76,0:00:39.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boleyn, listen!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.30,0:00:43.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That lady is seriously bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.68,0:00:46.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's the one who did the\Nawful thing that made you sad!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.06,0:00:48.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whatever that is...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.98,0:00:50.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.48,0:00:51.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think I'm dumb?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.68,0:00:52.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're still my enemy!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.38,0:00:56.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I'm done with\NTrampasaurus, you're next!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.74,0:00:59.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurrah!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.20,0:01:02.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go, Ulti! You got this!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.56,0:01:05.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's avenge Papa together! Oh, shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.06,0:01:07.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think I'm dumb?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.16,0:01:09.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I'm done with that hag, you're next!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.86,0:01:14.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Komachiyo, let's book it!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.76,0:01:17.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go and don't look back!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.14,0:01:19.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh? Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.86,0:01:21.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stay there!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.86,0:01:23.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I still need to smash you!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.14,0:01:26.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ulti!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.76,0:01:28.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Spider!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.68,0:01:44.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Komachiyo!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.59,0:01:45.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm coming, buddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.12,0:01:50.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm ever, ever so sick of\Nchasing you little dirtbags.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.56,0:01:55.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And that goes for your big weird dog, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.66,0:01:58.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope that headbutt broke some bones.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.32,0:02:00.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A whole bunch of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.30,0:02:05.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stay away!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.46,0:02:10.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at the poor little\Npuppy, all beat up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.90,0:02:14.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's what you get for being naughty!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.28,0:02:18.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, play dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.02,0:02:23.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.54,0:02:28.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop it, you big man!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.64,0:02:31.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tama!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.55,0:02:32.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's my best friend!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.22,0:02:34.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He died. You had his idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.34,0:02:39.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shut up, rat!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.28,0:02:41.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tama!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.46,0:02:43.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Otama!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.80,0:02:44.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.34,0:02:48.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.96,0:02:50.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Carry her and run, Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.74,0:02:52.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're all gonna die! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.96,0:02:54.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.22,0:02:56.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.16,0:02:59.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How dare you lay a hand\Non my little friend! Ugh!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.16,0:03:03.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How dare you lay a hand\Non my little brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.64,0:03:04.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You filthy lizard!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.26,0:03:07.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How could you do that to a mother?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.64,0:03:15.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nami, stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.24,0:03:17.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We gotta go!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.76,0:03:18.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.04,0:03:20.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not this time!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.50,0:03:21.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.48,0:03:24.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not when she hit a child?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.52,0:03:30.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is personal!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.78,0:03:38.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll kick her ass myself!
