Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.18,0:05:24.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aye, that's Black-Legged Surge!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.30,0:05:26.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's got a bounty of 330 million berries!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.30,0:05:28.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How tough can he be?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.30,0:05:37.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, who's that dude he's carrying?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.00,0:05:40.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's gotta be the Pirate Hunter Zoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.58,0:05:42.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're crewmates! What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.20,0:05:45.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's Big Money carrying bigger money!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.30,0:05:47.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, watch what you say!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.10,0:05:52.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry big money is carrying\Nslightly less big money.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.72,0:05:53.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's not the issue.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.04,0:05:55.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, am I too noisy?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.12,0:05:57.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So sorry.
