Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.51,0:06:02.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.28,0:06:07.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, well, Captain Kid? Captain Kid?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.96,0:06:13.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, sorry, but you're not getting\Nthrough. Glad you guys showed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.56,0:06:14.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need some more scrap
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.44,0:06:28.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You, on the other hand, I don't need you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.14,0:06:36.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Suck on this!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.64,0:06:37.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're done!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.66,0:06:49.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Big Mom, where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.56,0:06:55.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good luck, I guess. Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.04,0:06:58.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That must have swapped us\Nwith something in the air.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.54,0:06:59.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.45,0:07:00.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Black Leg?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.37,0:07:02.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that Traffy and Moss Head?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.86,0:07:04.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't let us fall!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.04,0:07:09.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought you were on the roof.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.92,0:07:10.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.86,0:07:14.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where the heck am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.46,0:07:15.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And where did Mama go?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.12,0:07:17.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm coming, Mama, I promise!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.44,0:07:20.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Zeus!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.35,0:07:21.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.27,0:07:22.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where's Nami?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.46,0:07:24.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought you were working for her now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.14,0:07:28.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, come back here! Leave him be.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.76,0:07:30.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why the hell are you still sitting on me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.92,0:07:33.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This space is reserved for ladies only!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.42,0:07:34.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm glad we ended up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.80,0:07:35.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We could use the help.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.71,0:07:36.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.32,0:07:39.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just pop out of nowhere\Nand give me orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.62,0:07:40.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just take care of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.86,0:07:41.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's injured.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.22,0:07:45.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What happened to him?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.44,0:07:49.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.48,0:07:51.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't you at least explain\Nthe situation first?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.90,0:07:53.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's in real bad shape.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.62,0:07:55.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Probably broke 20 or 30 bones.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.02,0:07:58.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Splint up his body, put him on his back.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.28,0:07:59.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Make sure he's conscious and breathing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.06,0:08:02.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm worried about the battle,\Nnot this idiot's health!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.88,0:08:03.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the doctor!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.26,0:08:05.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why the hell don't you take care of him?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.06,0:08:08.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I would, but I need to shut down Big Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.42,0:08:09.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can do first aid at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.06,0:08:11.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What am I supposed to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.16,0:08:12.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just don't let him die!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.44,0:08:13.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.35,0:08:14.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't walk away from me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.86,0:08:17.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I told you I'm not the doctor here!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.24,0:08:28.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't know how to\Napply bandage, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.06,0:08:33.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've trussed a ham before.\NIt's basically the same thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.94,0:08:35.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I'm a ham to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.18,0:08:38.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way you taste that good. Never mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.06,0:08:41.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.64,0:08:53.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, uh, who managed to hurt you this bad?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.82,0:08:55.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kaido and Big Mom together.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.04,0:08:56.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No wonder.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.44,0:08:59.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, at least you found the roof.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.18,0:09:02.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I take it Luffy's in\Nbetter shape than you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.16,0:09:05.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's been rough, but I think\Nhe figured something out.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.48,0:09:06.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's gonna win this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.28,0:09:10.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't have to tell me that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.28,0:09:14.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a mess!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.82,0:09:19.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd stuff your ass in a\Ncloset if I had it my way!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.74,0:09:24.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sir Sangoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.46,0:09:26.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, Kappa.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.48,0:09:28.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Glad to see you guys are all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.02,0:09:33.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, hey, Nami.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.24,0:09:37.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I get that you're angry, but\Nwe gotta run away, quick!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.24,0:09:38.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She won't be out for long!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.82,0:09:41.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You saw how many times her\Nbrother came back to get us!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.70,0:09:43.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Also, Big Mom is right there!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.70,0:09:46.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No matter how you look\Nat it, we can't win!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.48,0:09:50.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even if we run, Ulti won't stop chasing\Nus until we take her out for good!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.58,0:09:55.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But more than that, I'm not letting\Nher go after what she did to Otama.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.42,0:09:57.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, Otama.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.84,0:09:58.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hang in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.86,0:10:01.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Otama, tell me you're okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.14,0:10:05.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know you're not dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.36,0:10:07.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get up already.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.12,0:10:16.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just can't wait for me to bust your\Nhead open like a big ripe melon.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.88,0:10:22.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, you see that, boys?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.04,0:10:24.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's got a baton!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.74,0:10:28.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This cheerleader thinks she can\Ntake out Lady Ulti on her own!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.26,0:10:31.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tornado!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.90,0:10:33.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tickle!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.30,0:10:41.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was a nice surprise\Nattack, but it's not enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.94,0:10:42.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You done yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.68,0:10:47.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.54,0:10:55.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, you want some too?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.66,0:10:57.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, weird little man.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.68,0:10:59.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once I'm done with her you are next.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.06,0:11:10.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've hated your guts from\Nthe first moment we met.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.82,0:11:16.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not only do you scurry away\Nlike a rat every chance you get,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.12,0:11:20.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You also said your crappy little captain\Nwas gonna be king of the pirates,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.06,0:11:23.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but no big deal, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.54,0:11:27.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'll all be worth it once I\Nfinally smash your skull in!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.90,0:11:29.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Palti!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.00,0:11:38.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, Nami, please don't die.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.98,0:11:42.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, Mama! Yes, Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.10,0:11:46.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, Mama! Yes, Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.46,0:11:49.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.34,0:12:03.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.46,0:12:11.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mesa-chanal!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.24,0:12:46.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She took out Lady Ulti in one shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.08,0:12:50.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And she took out her brother\Njust a second ago, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.02,0:12:54.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whose side is she supposed to be on?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.42,0:12:56.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nami, can you stand?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.16,0:12:59.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was crazy, but she's finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.18,0:13:01.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's run away. Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.64,0:13:02.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Call Mathieu.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.38,0:13:05.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't save him now. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.80,0:13:06.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll come back later.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.92,0:13:07.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.02,0:13:13.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh? Zeus?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.72,0:13:18.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If he's there, who's that other cloud?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.84,0:13:21.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.75,0:13:23.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We really hit it off, didn't we, Hera?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.58,0:13:28.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I could never pull off such an awesome\Ncombo attack with stupid old Zeus.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.66,0:13:31.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We made a pretty amazing team,\Ntoo, wouldn't you say, Hera?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.00,0:13:34.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You sad little simpletons are\Ngetting ahead of yourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.04,0:13:36.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All I did was follow Mama's lead.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.96,0:13:39.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at you teasing me. Aww.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.80,0:13:42.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so glad I asked Mama\Nto make me a girlfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.34,0:13:44.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And now here you are in the cloudy flesh.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.88,0:13:45.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your girlfriend?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.38,0:13:47.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, thank you. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.36,0:13:49.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.52,0:13:51.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I like my ladies a little fiery.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.82,0:13:56.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And either way, it's nice\Nto have a girl in the group.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.32,0:14:00.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Prometheus?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.78,0:14:01.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I agree.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.18,0:14:05.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So let's work together to\Nbe Mama's best helpers ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.14,0:14:06.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Napoleon?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.38,0:14:09.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Glad I threw Zeus out with the trash.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.54,0:14:12.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seems you three will\Nmake a much better team.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.50,0:14:13.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is messed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.12,0:14:16.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who is that girl? Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.64,0:14:19.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Zeus set a good example of what not to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.06,0:14:22.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's mean.

